Z||000000||Earne||03-15-2000||08:00 AM||||Does anyone recognize these corner lamps?  GM has a habit of "sharing" parts between makes and models.  I was wondering if anyone knows if these are original to this model or from a another vehicle.  They may have been used in a different orientation or in conjunction with another light.  By the way, this is the proposed 1989 Fiero GT front facia.  I'm determined to make and install one on my Toy.  I think this is well within keeping with the subtle changes I have already made.  Any info out there?||||reg||5
