Z||000013||Shiner||03-17-2000||12:46 AM||||I agree.  This is a PAINFULLY horrible editing job.  He took a pic of the '89 proto-type car, the side shot, reveresed the image so it was facing the other way, pasted the car on a new backround, added those rally wheels, and gave it a horrible looking paint scheme. If nobody belives me, I can provide proof of this.  I am glad this guy is not on the forum, I would have given him a cyber-beatdown.||||reg||1
