Z||000015||Shiner||03-17-2000||02:59 AM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/89Proof_2.JPG">  <BR>Okay, here is my pic!  Bear with me if this is screwed up, as it is my first foray into the world of PIP   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P> Take a look at the areas I have circled.  <BR>1) Notice the bottom of the rear wheel<BR>2) Check out the clearence between the nose and the front wheel<BR>3) In the rear clip, part of the original backround is visible through the plastic<BR>4) Near the rear facsia, if you look hard enough, you can see left over pixels from when this guy cut & pasted the car on the new backround<P>Also, you will notice that the light shining on the nose is EXACTLY the same, and that the 14" rally wheels are both pics of one wheel..<P> You be the judge   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Shiner (edited 03-17-2000).]||||reg||1
